(3847369, 544810, 60195, '<td valign="top">I just looked through the entire challenge, and yours is the first I''m voting on.  Wow.  Awesome use of angles, lighting, and characters to create a fantastic composition.  This goes to show - the use of all tools available in "Expert Editing" are not required to come up with an "Expert" image.  Yours easily portrays what IMO is the most SciFi emotion in the entire lot.  Well done. Rare that I give out a 10.  10, and a fav.</td>', 'I just looked through the entire challenge, and yours is the first I''m voting on.  Wow.  Awesome use of angles, lighting, and characters to create a fantastic composition.  This goes to show - the use of all tools available in "Expert Editing" are not required to come up with an "Expert" image.  Yours easily portrays what IMO is the most SciFi emotion in the entire lot.  Well done. Rare that I give out a 10.  10, and a fav.', '2007-06-29 01:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
