(3847885, 545021, 63267, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to say that a polarizer would have helped the glass relfection, then I thought maybe it adds to the picture.  then I read borders and Nick Santora and decided that the reflections are a distraction that I would have avoided.  I also think it would have been better if you didn''t repeat the clones.  The girl in white and pink are duplicated and that ruins the them for me.  Still a clean image so I will vote higher than my comments my suggest.</td>', 'At first I was going to say that a polarizer would have helped the glass relfection, then I thought maybe it adds to the picture.  then I read borders and Nick Santora and decided that the reflections are a distraction that I would have avoided.  I also think it would have been better if you didn''t repeat the clones.  The girl in white and pink are duplicated and that ruins the them for me.  Still a clean image so I will vote higher than my comments my suggest.', '2007-06-29 06:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
