(3849545, 541987, 52130, '<td valign="top">she''s pretty for a weird noseless blue alien. nice lighting and effect. hope this does well.</td>', 'she''s pretty for a weird noseless blue alien. nice lighting and effect. hope this does well.', '2007-06-29 18:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849557, 541675, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and i like the fact that you didn''t fill the frame with all sorts of monsters / machines just because you can. <br/> <br/>I am wondering though why you have shot it in such an obvious way - meaning, trying to explain too much.<br/> <br/>Why is she sitting there and why is the TV facing me? The only thing I can suggest is something I have seen before, which is to shoot from the side with a wide angle  to show the kid waiting and watching the tv, and you also get to see what''s on the tv screen. It would also add if the main light source is the TV itself. I think that angle is more intruiging. <br/> <br/>Maybe you were going with a different idea. In any case, it''s good.</td>', 'I like the idea and i like the fact that you didn''t fill the frame with all sorts of monsters / machines just because you can.  I am wondering though why you have shot it in such an obvious way - meaning, trying to explain too much. Why is she sitting there and why is the TV facing me? The only thing I can suggest is something I have seen before, which is to shoot from the side with a wide angle  to show the kid waiting and watching the tv, and you also get to see what''s on the tv screen. It would also add if the main light source is the TV itself. I think that angle is more intruiging.  Maybe you were going with a different idea. In any case, it''s good.', '2007-06-29 18:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849565, 543104, 66267, '<td valign="top">Really compelling, makes you think...</td>', 'Really compelling, makes you think...', '2007-06-29 18:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849577, 544402, 21714, '<td valign="top">The sort of shot perfect for a ring flash. I like the fact that you didn''t too much to the image to achive the result. Not sure about the bit where the texture is going through his hair and left bottom. <br/> <br/>I think it''s quite good.</td>', 'The sort of shot perfect for a ring flash. I like the fact that you didn''t too much to the image to achive the result. Not sure about the bit where the texture is going through his hair and left bottom.  I think it''s quite good.', '2007-06-29 18:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849593, 543876, 31403, '<td valign="top">love this on lots of levels, great work</td>', 'love this on lots of levels, great work', '2007-06-29 18:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
