(3853260, 544751, 23098, '<td valign="top">You''ve definitely imparted the idea of a cold alien here. Nice work.</td>', 'You''ve definitely imparted the idea of a cold alien here. Nice work.', '2007-07-01 10:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853265, 543904, 23098, '<td valign="top">Cool.  You''ve made this very beliveable. Good aliens and fires.</td>', 'Cool.  You''ve made this very beliveable. Good aliens and fires.', '2007-07-01 10:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853268, 544918, 23098, '<td valign="top">I got a chill when this opened. Nice work.</td>', 'I got a chill when this opened. Nice work.', '2007-07-01 10:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853418, 544584, 79587, '<td valign="top">very nice closeup. the color of the eyes is most attractive</td>', 'very nice closeup. the color of the eyes is most attractive', '2007-07-01 11:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853509, 543104, 20941, '<td valign="top">OMG! This is outstanding work, fantastic presentation and excellent use of expert editing, tasteful and not overwrought with cluttered graphics. Sensitive and beautiful 10</td>', 'OMG! This is outstanding work, fantastic presentation and excellent use of expert editing, tasteful and not overwrought with cluttered graphics. Sensitive and beautiful 10', '2007-07-01 12:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853750, 544535, 16197, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully beautiful image, however, I find three things that distract for me, the yellow orb seems a bit out of place, the blue neon building off center, and the lack of reflection of the moon in the water.</td>', 'What a wonderfully beautiful image, however, I find three things that distract for me, the yellow orb seems a bit out of place, the blue neon building off center, and the lack of reflection of the moon in the water.', '2007-07-01 13:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853762, 545021, 16197, '<td valign="top">nice idea, the children going down a slide helps create that ''pod'' like feeling.  I think that bothers me the most, are the reflections on the glass and the lack of consistency with the sizes.  Also, the young lady in the front, does not stand out terribly much from the back.  I think a little more separation would have been nice.  I great idea all the same.</td>', 'nice idea, the children going down a slide helps create that ''pod'' like feeling.  I think that bothers me the most, are the reflections on the glass and the lack of consistency with the sizes.  Also, the young lady in the front, does not stand out terribly much from the back.  I think a little more separation would have been nice.  I great idea all the same.', '2007-07-01 13:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853770, 544610, 16197, '<td valign="top">Plastic effect looks fun, the green background I enjoy.  However, the ''chin?'' piece  just looks smudged around.  I think I would have preferred a more streamlined look, plastic/metal.</td>', 'Plastic effect looks fun, the green background I enjoy.  However, the ''chin?'' piece  just looks smudged around.  I think I would have preferred a more streamlined look, plastic/metal.', '2007-07-01 14:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853776, 543161, 16197, '<td valign="top">I view this more as a fable than sci-fi.  That being said, I think there needs to be more consistent lighting between both objects in the image.  The two images appear very separated.  Maybe a trick you could have done, is add shadows of the fingers/hands to the bottom of the shoe to add that connective element.</td>', 'I view this more as a fable than sci-fi.  That being said, I think there needs to be more consistent lighting between both objects in the image.  The two images appear very separated.  Maybe a trick you could have done, is add shadows of the fingers/hands to the bottom of the shoe to add that connective element.', '2007-07-01 14:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853792, 544543, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, yet, the elements I don''t feel are put together strong enough.  I would see a straight arm/wrist as apposed to this angled version here.  Also, The skin edging you created, doesn''t give me a feel of robotics here.  Classically this type of thing is created with torn flesh or straight edged box type of covering.  The edgeing here, just doesn''t seem to hold out enough depth for me.  Also, I would see more mechanical functions in the wrist than electronically, lots of joints and stuff that need to move. but thats just my personal opinion.</td>', 'Fun idea, yet, the elements I don''t feel are put together strong enough.  I would see a straight arm/wrist as apposed to this angled version here.  Also, The skin edging you created, doesn''t give me a feel of robotics here.  Classically this type of thing is created with torn flesh or straight edged box type of covering.  The edgeing here, just doesn''t seem to hold out enough depth for me.  Also, I would see more mechanical functions in the wrist than electronically, lots of joints and stuff that need to move. but thats just my personal opinion.', '2007-07-01 14:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853817, 544788, 16197, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  This is a Fantastic style, and I have fav''d it.  However, for me, it has nothing to do with sci-fi.  Granted I could stretch my imagination and come up with something.<br/> <br/>''With the major pollutants of the 21st century''s technology jumps, man has in affect exhausted their water supply.  Even with the world being nearly three quarters water, the fresh water supply no longer exists except for a few heavily guarded mountain streams.  The beautiful bright colours man has always loved, is only remembered by faded pictures and electronic images.  The dried yellow and browns have since become the standard for all floral.  Now, in 2112 there is a single emotion that both plants and man share in one, that is "THIRST"''</td>', 'I love this image.  This is a Fantastic style, and I have fav''d it.  However, for me, it has nothing to do with sci-fi.  Granted I could stretch my imagination and come up with something. ''With the major pollutants of the 21st century''s technology jumps, man has in affect exhausted their water supply.  Even with the world being nearly three quarters water, the fresh water supply no longer exists except for a few heavily guarded mountain streams.  The beautiful bright colours man has always loved, is only remembered by faded pictures and electronic images.  The dried yellow and browns have since become the standard for all floral.  Now, in 2112 there is a single emotion that both plants and man share in one, that is "THIRST"''', '2007-07-01 14:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853829, 544977, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this idea, I believe this is more methos/fantasy than sci-fi.  Here, I would really enjoy if the images came together more smoothly.  The dragon still looks like a sculpture and there is something odd going on behind her head. I do enjoy the blue/black background, however, it isn''t consistent the lower left corner is different.</td>', 'I enjoy this idea, I believe this is more methos/fantasy than sci-fi.  Here, I would really enjoy if the images came together more smoothly.  The dragon still looks like a sculpture and there is something odd going on behind her head. I do enjoy the blue/black background, however, it isn''t consistent the lower left corner is different.', '2007-07-01 14:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853838, 545069, 16197, '<td valign="top">I am staring at this image, and it just doesn''t work anything for me.  I am assuming from the title, you mean aliens or something where the bright spot is... yet, without anything but a bright spot to look at I am at a loss.  If there was an saucer outline in the trees, or more definite figures it would have been stronger. as it is now, I just don''t see it.</td>', 'I am staring at this image, and it just doesn''t work anything for me.  I am assuming from the title, you mean aliens or something where the bright spot is... yet, without anything but a bright spot to look at I am at a loss.  If there was an saucer outline in the trees, or more definite figures it would have been stronger. as it is now, I just don''t see it.', '2007-07-01 14:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853845, 544402, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, nice and simple, however, I don''t care for the ringlight in his eyes.  Also, for some reason, the cords look off to me, as if they might have been added after the shot was taken. The gold moreso than the other.</td>', 'I like this concept, nice and simple, however, I don''t care for the ringlight in his eyes.  Also, for some reason, the cords look off to me, as if they might have been added after the shot was taken. The gold moreso than the other.', '2007-07-01 14:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853857, 543255, 16197, '<td valign="top">I saw this thumb the other day when I looked at them all.  I wonder to myself about the image.  For me, I think there is just to much separation between the background ''matrix code'' and the model.  They don''t feel connected in the image.  Also, even though it is nice even lighting, it just bothers me for some reason, like it is ''too'' clean for the concept of this image.</td>', 'I saw this thumb the other day when I looked at them all.  I wonder to myself about the image.  For me, I think there is just to much separation between the background ''matrix code'' and the model.  They don''t feel connected in the image.  Also, even though it is nice even lighting, it just bothers me for some reason, like it is ''too'' clean for the concept of this image.', '2007-07-01 14:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853862, 542339, 16197, '<td valign="top">I see this more as fantasy than sci-fi,  At first glance this is a decent image, but as I continue to look at the details it loses its mystery.  This image just doesn''t hold together at a closer inspection.  It is a fun idea, but doesn''t pull it off for me.</td>', 'I see this more as fantasy than sci-fi,  At first glance this is a decent image, but as I continue to look at the details it loses its mystery.  This image just doesn''t hold together at a closer inspection.  It is a fun idea, but doesn''t pull it off for me.', '2007-07-01 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3853869, 543038, 16197, '<td valign="top">The kiddo looks a little freaked out or laughing, which im not sure helps or hinders this image.  The rainbow effect I don''t really care for, it looks alright, but just doesn''t do it for me.  This image is very odd.  I think the large tans/sand distract from the brights and throws this image off balance for me.</td>', 'The kiddo looks a little freaked out or laughing, which im not sure helps or hinders this image.  The rainbow effect I don''t really care for, it looks alright, but just doesn''t do it for me.  This image is very odd.  I think the large tans/sand distract from the brights and throws this image off balance for me.', '2007-07-01 14:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853877, 544608, 16197, '<td valign="top">fun image, nice concept, however the cart seems to have the wrong lighting.  Direct lighting from above, would leave a shadow on the underside of the cart, I believe it would be strong enough to see better.  and if that is how it looks, it should have been darked to create that dramatic single light feel.  Also, the lamp post I believe also distracts from this image, maybe having a different angle or dimming that light would help.</td>', 'fun image, nice concept, however the cart seems to have the wrong lighting.  Direct lighting from above, would leave a shadow on the underside of the cart, I believe it would be strong enough to see better.  and if that is how it looks, it should have been darked to create that dramatic single light feel.  Also, the lamp post I believe also distracts from this image, maybe having a different angle or dimming that light would help.', '2007-07-01 14:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853885, 544853, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, ''Big Brother is Watching'' has always been popular.  However, for me, something just doesn''t hold together, it took me a while to look at this image and not think ''satellite'' but camera.  Nice idea, just doesn''t give me the sci-fi vibe.</td>', 'Interesting concept, ''Big Brother is Watching'' has always been popular.  However, for me, something just doesn''t hold together, it took me a while to look at this image and not think ''satellite'' but camera.  Nice idea, just doesn''t give me the sci-fi vibe.', '2007-07-01 14:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853890, 544850, 16197, '<td valign="top">the balance between the saucers and buildings look nice. yet, the flames look disembodied and very out of place.  I think maybe some dark dodging or something to add a more connective element between them.</td>', 'the balance between the saucers and buildings look nice. yet, the flames look disembodied and very out of place.  I think maybe some dark dodging or something to add a more connective element between them.', '2007-07-01 14:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853892, 543439, 16197, '<td valign="top">nice idea, fun title, just doesn''t give me enough.  I do enjoy the colours and concept, just not pushed far enough for me.</td>', 'nice idea, fun title, just doesn''t give me enough.  I do enjoy the colours and concept, just not pushed far enough for me.', '2007-07-01 14:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853902, 544879, 16197, '<td valign="top">It looks like a fun play yard equipment I have been on.  Nice idea, but for some reason, it just doesn''t hold together for me. Over sharpness or outlining crops just keep everything part.  I also think, this type of item would scream to be on stilts or something... make it look taller taller and even taller.</td>', 'It looks like a fun play yard equipment I have been on.  Nice idea, but for some reason, it just doesn''t hold together for me. Over sharpness or outlining crops just keep everything part.  I also think, this type of item would scream to be on stilts or something... make it look taller taller and even taller.', '2007-07-01 14:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853906, 544553, 16197, '<td valign="top">interesting idea.  Just for some reason the box edges are really throwing me for a look, they just don''t appear very clean.  The tray also seems to be the wrong style for this in my opinion.  I would have liked to see these on a kitchen table or something.</td>', 'interesting idea.  Just for some reason the box edges are really throwing me for a look, they just don''t appear very clean.  The tray also seems to be the wrong style for this in my opinion.  I would have liked to see these on a kitchen table or something.', '2007-07-01 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853909, 544926, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a cute image, not everyday you see someone using a flyswatter at a flying saucer.  I think I would have preferred a cleaner looking saucer, just as well lit and clean as the model.</td>', 'This is a cute image, not everyday you see someone using a flyswatter at a flying saucer.  I think I would have preferred a cleaner looking saucer, just as well lit and clean as the model.', '2007-07-01 14:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853910, 545039, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fun image, interesting expression, just for me, it doesn''t push the subject enough.</td>', 'Fun image, interesting expression, just for me, it doesn''t push the subject enough.', '2007-07-01 14:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853913, 541808, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, decent image overall... but for some reason it just doesn''t pull together enough for me.  Not sure if I love or hate the floating screen, but, the old style on the window speakers really just throw off a floating screen.</td>', 'Nice concept, decent image overall... but for some reason it just doesn''t pull together enough for me.  Not sure if I love or hate the floating screen, but, the old style on the window speakers really just throw off a floating screen.', '2007-07-01 14:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853917, 544872, 16197, '<td valign="top">this image really pushes the editing.  However for me, it pushed to too far.  I am a fan of extreme editing and such, yet this feels more so as digital art than photograph.  To tell the truth, I can not see a photographic element in this image.</td>', 'this image really pushes the editing.  However for me, it pushed to too far.  I am a fan of extreme editing and such, yet this feels more so as digital art than photograph.  To tell the truth, I can not see a photographic element in this image.', '2007-07-01 14:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853920, 544884, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very fun idea, nicely put together, but a tad flat with the wheat and machines.  I would have enjoyed a bit more separation between everything, touch more contrasty maybe, curves? hmmm yet, one of the better images in my opinion.</td>', 'Very fun idea, nicely put together, but a tad flat with the wheat and machines.  I would have enjoyed a bit more separation between everything, touch more contrasty maybe, curves? hmmm yet, one of the better images in my opinion.', '2007-07-01 14:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853922, 545040, 16197, '<td valign="top">how every cute, although I foresee issues with palm plugs as those.  It will not allow any other function of the hand, specially those the hand is designed for, like gripping a coffee cup.  Also, I would have liked to see the plugs a bit cleaner with the instillation.  But a fun image overall.</td>', 'how every cute, although I foresee issues with palm plugs as those.  It will not allow any other function of the hand, specially those the hand is designed for, like gripping a coffee cup.  Also, I would have liked to see the plugs a bit cleaner with the instillation.  But a fun image overall.', '2007-07-01 14:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853927, 543876, 16197, '<td valign="top">First thought in my head was Lawnmower Man.  Very interesting concept and really pushing the editing rules.  As fun as this is, it just does not feel as photographic as it should for me.</td>', 'First thought in my head was Lawnmower Man.  Very interesting concept and really pushing the editing rules.  As fun as this is, it just does not feel as photographic as it should for me.', '2007-07-01 14:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853930, 544100, 16197, '<td valign="top">nice idea and concept, however, just doesn''t push the boundaries enough for me.  When I think of sci-fi, I think of something not of this world, and to me, this is just a circuit board.  Now, if you put little people in there it would have helped.</td>', 'nice idea and concept, however, just doesn''t push the boundaries enough for me.  When I think of sci-fi, I think of something not of this world, and to me, this is just a circuit board.  Now, if you put little people in there it would have helped.', '2007-07-01 14:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853934, 542436, 16197, '<td valign="top">even though I noticed the model first, I find the cat to be the best part of this image.  Great expression and look, the rest of the image, just doesn''t pull enough for me to believe it, also the half of torso, just doesn''t vibe with the concept.  If being pulled up, it would be led to believe the top half would go first.</td>', 'even though I noticed the model first, I find the cat to be the best part of this image.  Great expression and look, the rest of the image, just doesn''t pull enough for me to believe it, also the half of torso, just doesn''t vibe with the concept.  If being pulled up, it would be led to believe the top half would go first.', '2007-07-01 14:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853939, 544918, 16197, '<td valign="top">very creepy, I think I saw her on one of those grocery store mags.  Nice concept, and it appears fairly well done.  It''s just missing something for me, and I can''t quite put my finger on it, just feels... incomplete.</td>', 'very creepy, I think I saw her on one of those grocery store mags.  Nice concept, and it appears fairly well done.  It''s just missing something for me, and I can''t quite put my finger on it, just feels... incomplete.', '2007-07-01 14:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3853943, 543948, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, but what I see wrong, is the circuit board overlay needs some shape.  Needs to be more form fitting.  Take the piece across the nose, a nose curves up and down, however the piece is straight across the bridge.  It really distracts.  Also, the pieces in the eyes also really distract, I think this would have done just as well as black pits, or ice blue.  Just remember, when you over lay something, remember to shape to the contours and not just smack on top.</td>', 'Fun idea, but what I see wrong, is the circuit board overlay needs some shape.  Needs to be more form fitting.  Take the piece across the nose, a nose curves up and down, however the piece is straight across the bridge.  It really distracts.  Also, the pieces in the eyes also really distract, I think this would have done just as well as black pits, or ice blue.  Just remember, when you over lay something, remember to shape to the contours and not just smack on top.', '2007-07-01 14:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
