(3856452, 543161, 57260, '<td valign="top">Yeah this pretty much looks like your run-of-the-mill domestic violence scene where the woman makes her man feel 3 inches tall and steps on him. Only critique is that the lighting on him doesn''t match the lighting of the rest of the scene. I know it''s a difficult one to pull off but the fact that the lighting on his side and hands looks much harsher, makes it look cut out and deprives it of a sense of realism. 7</td>', 'Yeah this pretty much looks like your run-of-the-mill domestic violence scene where the woman makes her man feel 3 inches tall and steps on him. Only critique is that the lighting on him doesn''t match the lighting of the rest of the scene. I know it''s a difficult one to pull off but the fact that the lighting on his side and hands looks much harsher, makes it look cut out and deprives it of a sense of realism. 7', '2007-07-02 04:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
