(3860128, 543520, 56503, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the selective desat. on this photo.  The one in the middle with four eyes is a little hard to look at because pf the placement of the eyes.  This creates the optical illusion that it is shaking.  Great colors and composition.</td>', 'I like the use of the selective desat. on this photo.  The one in the middle with four eyes is a little hard to look at because pf the placement of the eyes.  This creates the optical illusion that it is shaking.  Great colors and composition.', '2007-07-02 20:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3860140, 543876, 56503, '<td valign="top">The effects on this photo really enhance it.  The expression on the..ah.."character" is really good.  Definitely fits the challenge.</td>', 'The effects on this photo really enhance it.  The expression on the..ah.."character" is really good.  Definitely fits the challenge.', '2007-07-02 20:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
