(3861898, 543104, 53316, '<td valign="top">I do like the image as-is.  I gave it an 8.  But I do think that it might have been improved by focusing on the face and hand more.  There is so much emotion in the face and showing more detail there with a tighter crop, and getting rid of the extraneous, sort of fake looking torso, might have helped some.  But like I said, I do like it. :-)</td>', 'I do like the image as-is.  I gave it an 8.  But I do think that it might have been improved by focusing on the face and hand more.  There is so much emotion in the face and showing more detail there with a tighter crop, and getting rid of the extraneous, sort of fake looking torso, might have helped some.  But like I said, I do like it. :-)', '2007-07-03 03:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
