(3865541, 544402, 53316, '<td valign="top">The super-boldness of the eyebrows kind of distract me, and the light in the eyes as well a tad, but this is still a 10 in my book.  I love how it''s obviously coming from a photo, but still taking advantage of the expert rules.  Colors and textures are great and there is so much mystery and emotion.</td>', 'The super-boldness of the eyebrows kind of distract me, and the light in the eyes as well a tad, but this is still a 10 in my book.  I love how it''s obviously coming from a photo, but still taking advantage of the expert rules.  Colors and textures are great and there is so much mystery and emotion.', '2007-07-04 02:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
