(3868396, 544961, 80311, '<td valign="top">Great... but I find the book "IT" distracting since the creature is basicly a clown (not so science-fiction)...  an horror science-fiction book would of gave a better effect (like The Thing).  Excellent creature by the way!</td>', 'Great... but I find the book "IT" distracting since the creature is basicly a clown (not so science-fiction)...  an horror science-fiction book would of gave a better effect (like The Thing).  Excellent creature by the way!', '2007-07-04 17:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
