(3869021, 544535, 57260, '<td valign="top">Cool! This is really well done. I would''ve boosted the contrast a bit and get the blacks blacker because it seems a little flat especially where the water is, but I like the composition.</td>', 'Cool! This is really well done. I would''ve boosted the contrast a bit and get the blacks blacker because it seems a little flat especially where the water is, but I like the composition.', '2007-07-04 20:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
