(3869532, 543104, 80887, '<td valign="top">Love it. Thought-provoking.</td>', 'Love it. Thought-provoking.', '2007-07-04 23:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869631, 544535, 66348, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking I know whose shot this is, and I have to say, It is a top 5. No questions asked. Well done. Well edited. Compositon is right on. And congrats on a stunning image. 10!!!!!!</td>', 'I''m thinking I know whose shot this is, and I have to say, It is a top 5. No questions asked. Well done. Well edited. Compositon is right on. And congrats on a stunning image. 10!!!!!!', '2007-07-05 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869892, 545042, 77195, '<td valign="top">oh man. how do you guys do this.</td>', 'oh man. how do you guys do this.', '2007-07-05 02:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869902, 543104, 77195, '<td valign="top">sigh. looking at pictures like this just make me want to cry and give up photography. how do you guys do this? may you suggest as to what books i could read in order to start to develop my skills in this kind of thing?<br/> <br/>oh and of course, it is a 10 from me. first 10 i have given so far. i know you dont have much competition in this challenge but this is by far one of the best photo i have seen in a long long time.Well done</td>', 'sigh. looking at pictures like this just make me want to cry and give up photography. how do you guys do this? may you suggest as to what books i could read in order to start to develop my skills in this kind of thing? oh and of course, it is a 10 from me. first 10 i have given so far. i know you dont have much competition in this challenge but this is by far one of the best photo i have seen in a long long time.Well done', '2007-07-05 02:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869903, 544402, 77195, '<td valign="top">lovely background texture with wonderful lighting on the model.</td>', 'lovely background texture with wonderful lighting on the model.', '2007-07-05 02:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
