(3870209, 545069, 39430, '<td valign="top">Apart from the title, this photo is not sci-fi at all.  Sorry.</td>', 'Apart from the title, this photo is not sci-fi at all.  Sorry.', '2007-07-05 07:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870210, 544292, 39430, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus on the planet I think is detracting from the impact</td>', 'The lack of focus on the planet I think is detracting from the impact', '2007-07-05 07:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870211, 541987, 11078, '<td valign="top">A wonderful image shows imagination and talent well done 9</td>', 'A wonderful image shows imagination and talent well done 9', '2007-07-05 07:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870212, 545035, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the the colours and levels of the main image could be better.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the the colours and levels of the main image could be better.', '2007-07-05 07:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870216, 544535, 11078, '<td valign="top">Wow what shot! like so many in this challenge Imagination is awesome to come up with this I am going to give you a 10 I love this</td>', 'Wow what shot! like so many in this challenge Imagination is awesome to come up with this I am going to give you a 10 I love this', '2007-07-05 07:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870218, 545063, 39430, '<td valign="top">Strange composite.  Unfortunately, it''s more abstract than anything else, and looks to be more creative art than photograph.  But it still looks good overall.</td>', 'Strange composite.  Unfortunately, it''s more abstract than anything else, and looks to be more creative art than photograph.  But it still looks good overall.', '2007-07-05 07:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870219, 545042, 39430, '<td valign="top">I shudder to think what some of the attachments are for.  :(  Nice smooth tones and subtle colouring.</td>', 'I shudder to think what some of the attachments are for.  :(  Nice smooth tones and subtle colouring.', '2007-07-05 07:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870221, 544333, 39430, '<td valign="top">Photographically, there''s not much here, is there?</td>', 'Photographically, there''s not much here, is there?', '2007-07-05 07:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870222, 543876, 11078, '<td valign="top">Wow a 10 for sheer talent</td>', 'Wow a 10 for sheer talent', '2007-07-05 07:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870224, 544999, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I don''t really like the contrasty treatment.  Might be better if it was a little less over the top.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I don''t really like the contrasty treatment.  Might be better if it was a little less over the top.', '2007-07-05 07:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870225, 543038, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow, physchadelic.</td>', 'Wow, physchadelic.', '2007-07-05 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870226, 544490, 39430, '<td valign="top">Cool space effect.  However, overall, the image is lacking in a clear subject.  It might be better with more lighting on the ships, and if they were close.</td>', 'Cool space effect.  However, overall, the image is lacking in a clear subject.  It might be better with more lighting on the ships, and if they were close.', '2007-07-05 07:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870229, 543104, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice work!</td>', 'Nice work!', '2007-07-05 07:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870230, 544535, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice composite, and well balanced.</td>', 'Nice composite, and well balanced.', '2007-07-05 07:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870231, 544810, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very futuristic look, and nice dynamic lines.  The ''reflection'' of the old building is a little out of keeping with the rest of the image.</td>', 'Very futuristic look, and nice dynamic lines.  The ''reflection'' of the old building is a little out of keeping with the rest of the image.', '2007-07-05 07:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870233, 543876, 39430, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Almost looks like a tribal painting with the style of work.</td>', 'Ouch!  Almost looks like a tribal painting with the style of work.', '2007-07-05 07:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870252, 545041, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  You can still see the wrinkles in the fabric of space.  :)</td>', 'Nice idea.  You can still see the wrinkles in the fabric of space.  :)', '2007-07-05 07:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870253, 544399, 39430, '<td valign="top">You''ve really captured the 1970s cinematography with your lighting and colours setup.</td>', 'You''ve really captured the 1970s cinematography with your lighting and colours setup.', '2007-07-05 07:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870255, 544751, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice editing work!</td>', 'Nice editing work!', '2007-07-05 07:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870257, 544673, 39430, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s some severe editing!</td>', 'Wow, that''s some severe editing!', '2007-07-05 07:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870259, 544629, 39430, '<td valign="top">The colour treatment doesn''t really work for me.  Perhaps using layers, you could introduce some more colours so it doesn''t just look like a WB problem.</td>', 'The colour treatment doesn''t really work for me.  Perhaps using layers, you could introduce some more colours so it doesn''t just look like a WB problem.', '2007-07-05 07:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870261, 544952, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the subject is lost on me.  What is it?</td>', 'I''m afraid the subject is lost on me.  What is it?', '2007-07-05 07:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870265, 541987, 39430, '<td valign="top">Oooh, nice editing work.  very alien.  I like the selective softness, however, I''d prefer to see a little more contrast and highlight sharpness to pop the image.  I normally hate the top-bottom border look, but it actually works here, probably because Sci-Fi movies are widescreen.  :)</td>', 'Oooh, nice editing work.  very alien.  I like the selective softness, however, I''d prefer to see a little more contrast and highlight sharpness to pop the image.  I normally hate the top-bottom border look, but it actually works here, probably because Sci-Fi movies are widescreen.  :)', '2007-07-05 07:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870268, 541808, 39430, '<td valign="top">The false-colour editing was a popular sci-fi effect in those days, but unfotunately I don''t really like it.</td>', 'The false-colour editing was a popular sci-fi effect in those days, but unfotunately I don''t really like it.', '2007-07-05 07:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870283, 544977, 39430, '<td valign="top">Aha, no prizes for guessing whose image this is.  :)  Nice editing work, but the lighting is a little harsh and contrasty.  Some extra sharpening or smooth HDR adjustments would help this image a lot.  The sword is quite hidden from the angle - might be better to hold it more vertically.</td>', 'Aha, no prizes for guessing whose image this is.  :)  Nice editing work, but the lighting is a little harsh and contrasty.  Some extra sharpening or smooth HDR adjustments would help this image a lot.  The sword is quite hidden from the angle - might be better to hold it more vertically.', '2007-07-05 07:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870287, 545040, 39430, '<td valign="top">Could be improved with a closer crop.  (I think hairy arms go out of fashion in the year 2020)  :)</td>', 'Could be improved with a closer crop.  (I think hairy arms go out of fashion in the year 2020)  :)', '2007-07-05 07:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870289, 541675, 39430, '<td valign="top">The -ve space at the top of the images is wasted imho.  Would be better with a closer crop.  Nice feeling and desat.</td>', 'The -ve space at the top of the images is wasted imho.  Would be better with a closer crop.  Nice feeling and desat.', '2007-07-05 07:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870294, 544091, 39430, '<td valign="top">The composition of the different images works well.</td>', 'The composition of the different images works well.', '2007-07-05 07:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870299, 543161, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but the colours could be a little more interesting.  The lighting on the man is very direct and harsh, but the background lighting is softer and more general.  The image would be helped if they were more congruous.</td>', 'Nice concept, but the colours could be a little more interesting.  The lighting on the man is very direct and harsh, but the background lighting is softer and more general.  The image would be helped if they were more congruous.', '2007-07-05 07:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870307, 545039, 39430, '<td valign="top">There''s quite a bit of noise there, and I would prefer to see a stronger vignette.  However, this is still a fantastic image.  I love the colours and the deformation.</td>', 'There''s quite a bit of noise there, and I would prefer to see a stronger vignette.  However, this is still a fantastic image.  I love the colours and the deformation.', '2007-07-05 07:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870309, 544810, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very good processing, well done.</td>', 'Very good processing, well done.', '2007-07-05 07:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870312, 542024, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very good post processing, well done.</td>', 'Very good post processing, well done.', '2007-07-05 07:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870318, 544722, 39430, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the colour treatment.  It has made the image very flat and low-contrast.  The people also detract a little.  They don''t look very otherworldly at all.</td>', 'I don''t really like the colour treatment.  It has made the image very flat and low-contrast.  The people also detract a little.  They don''t look very otherworldly at all.', '2007-07-05 07:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870322, 543886, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very good post processing, well done.</td>', 'Very good post processing, well done.', '2007-07-05 07:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870323, 543948, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very good post processing, well done.</td>', 'Very good post processing, well done.', '2007-07-05 07:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870325, 542339, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very good processing, well done.</td>', 'Very good processing, well done.', '2007-07-05 07:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870328, 544402, 32345, '<td valign="top">Very good processing, well done.</td>', 'Very good processing, well done.', '2007-07-05 07:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870330, 541987, 32345, '<td valign="top">WOW, excellent picture, great expression</td>', 'WOW, excellent picture, great expression', '2007-07-05 07:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870334, 544788, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not so keen on the high-contrast editing.</td>', 'I''m not so keen on the high-contrast editing.', '2007-07-05 07:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870355, 544901, 39430, '<td valign="top">The editing around the moon is very visible.  Nice angle and lighting on Ben''s face.  By the way, to get a good photo of the moon, you probably need to set the AV lower.  By default, the camera will expose for the sky, because that''s most of the shot.  So, drop the Av down to -2, or use manual mode, and you''ll be able to get a much better shot of the moon with some detail in it.</td>', 'The editing around the moon is very visible.  Nice angle and lighting on Ben''s face.  By the way, to get a good photo of the moon, you probably need to set the AV lower.  By default, the camera will expose for the sky, because that''s most of the shot.  So, drop the Av down to -2, or use manual mode, and you''ll be able to get a much better shot of the moon with some detail in it.', '2007-07-05 08:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870364, 545006, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice composite.  The BW actually works really well to give it that BBC sci-fi look.  The lighting works well between the 2 images.</td>', 'Nice composite.  The BW actually works really well to give it that BBC sci-fi look.  The lighting works well between the 2 images.', '2007-07-05 08:06:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3870368, 543904, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice widescreen movie.  :)  I normally hate this type of border, but it really works here.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice widescreen movie.  :)  I normally hate this type of border, but it really works here.  Nicely done.', '2007-07-05 08:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870373, 545036, 39430, '<td valign="top">This might have been better left in colour.</td>', 'This might have been better left in colour.', '2007-07-05 08:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870387, 544584, 39430, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot!  I''d love to see this shot re-edited a little more strongly, to really make it pop, and maybe give it a slightly grungy cartoon look.  I love the lighting and the close crop, and the texture of the eye and the highlight is magic.  This image is really really cool, but falls just short of a 10 for me.  I''d love to do an edit of this image, just for my own practice.</td>', 'Really nice shot!  I''d love to see this shot re-edited a little more strongly, to really make it pop, and maybe give it a slightly grungy cartoon look.  I love the lighting and the close crop, and the texture of the eye and the highlight is magic.  This image is really really cool, but falls just short of a 10 for me.  I''d love to do an edit of this image, just for my own practice.', '2007-07-05 08:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870393, 543689, 39430, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the editing (cool lens flare).  The colours are a little off though.  Try experimenting with the colour balance to reduce the orange on the buildings (although it works well for the the sucked up beams)</td>', 'I like the idea and the editing (cool lens flare).  The colours are a little off though.  Try experimenting with the colour balance to reduce the orange on the buildings (although it works well for the the sucked up beams)', '2007-07-05 08:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870398, 544656, 39430, '<td valign="top">What''s the thing at the top left?</td>', 'What''s the thing at the top left?', '2007-07-05 08:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870415, 544918, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice editing, and a great result.  My only suggestion might be to dodge+USM some of the tree and vines to add a little more contrast and definition.  Even still, great work.  Perfect title too.  Full marks.</td>', 'Nice editing, and a great result.  My only suggestion might be to dodge+USM some of the tree and vines to add a little more contrast and definition.  Even still, great work.  Perfect title too.  Full marks.', '2007-07-05 08:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870420, 542436, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice images, but the editing is a little cut-and-paste looking.</td>', 'Nice images, but the editing is a little cut-and-paste looking.', '2007-07-05 08:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870423, 544402, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice editing work, and a great photo.</td>', 'Nice editing work, and a great photo.', '2007-07-05 08:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870430, 544961, 39430, '<td valign="top">Eeew, that thing is truly horrible.  Nice editing work. (assuming it''s not just a real photo - I feel like this some mornings)</td>', 'Eeew, that thing is truly horrible.  Nice editing work. (assuming it''s not just a real photo - I feel like this some mornings)', '2007-07-05 08:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870435, 545028, 39430, '<td valign="top">Ooh, very surreal.</td>', 'Ooh, very surreal.', '2007-07-05 08:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3870441, 543237, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and editing.  Could do with some more shadows around his feet, to help blend the images.</td>', 'Nice setup and editing.  Could do with some more shadows around his feet, to help blend the images.', '2007-07-05 08:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
