(3874855, 545059, 74979, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> this is pretty nifty &amp; i reckon it should''v done heaps better ... i wonder if he spilled the beans, he''s in the right position !!?? .. i notice that you have intentionally positioned the leg of the guy being tortured so as to maintain the modesty of the plastic guy .. . as you''d know it''d be a dq if that leg was just a bit to the side !! .. :):) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>during voting I thought this was great, now i can''t decide what''s more fun-the image or the comments!  great morning giggles as I read these...</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: this is pretty nifty & i reckon it should''v done heaps better ... i wonder if he spilled the beans, he''s in the right position !!?? .. i notice that you have intentionally positioned the leg of the guy being tortured so as to maintain the modesty of the plastic guy .. . as you''d know it''d be a dq if that leg was just a bit to the side !! .. :):)   during voting I thought this was great, now i can''t decide what''s more fun-the image or the comments!  great morning giggles as I read these...', '2007-07-06 08:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
