(3874881, 545063, 67697, '<td valign="top">So abstract!  Just a ton of things to look thru here.  I''d love to know what the black blobby thing is on the lower left lol.</td>', 'So abstract!  Just a ton of things to look thru here.  I''d love to know what the black blobby thing is on the lower left lol.', '2007-07-06 09:07:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874882, 543876, 25355, '<td valign="top">I really thought this was in Australia, but I didn''t mention it. Now that I know it is, the landscape reminds of Nolan''s Kelly paintings. In a very high-sccoring challenge, this was one of my three 10s (the winner and Doc''s were my other two ;-Þ)<br/>   I''m sure what images you started with and editing details would be very a very interesting read.</td>', 'I really thought this was in Australia, but I didn''t mention it. Now that I know it is, the landscape reminds of Nolan''s Kelly paintings. In a very high-sccoring challenge, this was one of my three 10s (the winner and Doc''s were my other two ;-Þ)   I''m sure what images you started with and editing details would be very a very interesting read.', '2007-07-06 09:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3874883, 544853, 53572, '<td valign="top">excellent image, rob.  i gave it an 8.  it fitted the theme very well indeed - as thankfully orwell''s dystopia is still (somewhat, although i''ve been hearing rather worrying things from the uk) sci-fi.  i like the fact that you used the expert editing subtly, and made it wrk for you.  great stuff!</td>', 'excellent image, rob.  i gave it an 8.  it fitted the theme very well indeed - as thankfully orwell''s dystopia is still (somewhat, although i''ve been hearing rather worrying things from the uk) sci-fi.  i like the fact that you used the expert editing subtly, and made it wrk for you.  great stuff!', '2007-07-06 09:08:36.000000', NULL, 0),
