(3874975, 544947, 76198, '<td valign="top">Huh. It''s remarkable to me that people didn''t ''get'' this shot. Perfect capture of a particular era... Tones are great, slight softness of focus is not only ok but absolutely necessary to preserve the feel. on my monitor it could use just a touch more contrast, perhaps? Maybe that''s just a personal taste thing. But a finely crafted image nonetheless. <br/> <br/>I didn''t vote this, but I would have given an 8 or a 9.</td>', 'Huh. It''s remarkable to me that people didn''t ''get'' this shot. Perfect capture of a particular era... Tones are great, slight softness of focus is not only ok but absolutely necessary to preserve the feel. on my monitor it could use just a touch more contrast, perhaps? Maybe that''s just a personal taste thing. But a finely crafted image nonetheless.  I didn''t vote this, but I would have given an 8 or a 9.', '2007-07-06 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 0),
