(3875066, 543104, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue ribbon.  I was one of your 53 9''s.  You may wonder why I held back from the 10, it is only that to me the final result seemed more like illustration than photograpy, so that I couldn''t bring myself to give it a 10.  Beautiful job, nonetheless.  I strongly suspected this would win the challenge (as it did).  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations on your blue ribbon.  I was one of your 53 9''s.  You may wonder why I held back from the 10, it is only that to me the final result seemed more like illustration than photograpy, so that I couldn''t bring myself to give it a 10.  Beautiful job, nonetheless.  I strongly suspected this would win the challenge (as it did).   ', '2007-07-06 10:31:09.000000', NULL, 0),
