(3879033, 543104, 3746, '<td valign="top">The great thing about this image is, it wll be referred back to countless times if there is any doubt over whether a photo is legal in expert or not, this has many elements that may generally be regarded as breaking the rules, the fact it has scored so well and been allowed by SC will certainly set a precedent in future expert editing challenges.. so well done on another level as well.</td>', 'The great thing about this image is, it wll be referred back to countless times if there is any doubt over whether a photo is legal in expert or not, this has many elements that may generally be regarded as breaking the rules, the fact it has scored so well and been allowed by SC will certainly set a precedent in future expert editing challenges.. so well done on another level as well.', '2007-07-07 18:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3879040, 544977, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well I thought this was a wonderful piece of fantasy art and I swear I wouldnt mess with you...you look like a cross between Boudicia and the defender of the faith<br/> <br/>Ace PP and those that voted 1 2 and 3 have - imo - got some issues going on were they cant differentiate between great photography and personal taste</td>', 'Well I thought this was a wonderful piece of fantasy art and I swear I wouldnt mess with you...you look like a cross between Boudicia and the defender of the faith Ace PP and those that voted 1 2 and 3 have - imo - got some issues going on were they cant differentiate between great photography and personal taste', '2007-07-07 18:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3879195, 543104, 2158, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the amazing score - well deserved, I must add.  The emotion in the image is remarkable.</td>', 'Congratulations on the amazing score - well deserved, I must add.  The emotion in the image is remarkable.', '2007-07-07 19:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3879271, 544543, 62318, '<td valign="top">I love the intent, great idea. I think the static background doesn''t work for this subject (too much black for me). Maybe a different angle would have worked better (done the length of the arm...). Still I thought it was innovative and the post skills are way above my own. I voted you a 6 in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the intent, great idea. I think the static background doesn''t work for this subject (too much black for me). Maybe a different angle would have worked better (done the length of the arm...). Still I thought it was innovative and the post skills are way above my own. I voted you a 6 in the challenge.', '2007-07-07 20:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3879805, 544543, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think you did a good job on the electronics insertion. I wonder if there is a way you might be able to use Bevel and Contour to create the inset effect. Maybe you could have done that manually. They use screen and multiply on the edges to create the bevel. I find the watch and even the ring distracting and out of place. Noise reduction could be used to give the skin a little more plastic/artificial look.</td>', 'I think you did a good job on the electronics insertion. I wonder if there is a way you might be able to use Bevel and Contour to create the inset effect. Maybe you could have done that manually. They use screen and multiply on the edges to create the bevel. I find the watch and even the ring distracting and out of place. Noise reduction could be used to give the skin a little more plastic/artificial look.', '2007-07-07 23:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3880337, 543104, 63824, '<td valign="top">wow love it! Congrats for the ribbon !</td>', 'wow love it! Congrats for the ribbon !', '2007-07-08 01:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
