(3883958, 543104, 51164, '<td valign="top">After this image, it is a little difficult to look at some of the other images, both in this contest &amp; others posted this week. It''s rather like comparing Renoir to an artist selling his first canvas on a street corner. <br/>Okay, maybe an unfair comparison, but my point is that you have changed the precedent for this site. At least, my paradigm of "editing" has been shifted ... my expectations of ribbon winners has been raised. <br/>In short... you rock my world!!! =)</td>', 'After this image, it is a little difficult to look at some of the other images, both in this contest & others posted this week. It''s rather like comparing Renoir to an artist selling his first canvas on a street corner. Okay, maybe an unfair comparison, but my point is that you have changed the precedent for this site. At least, my paradigm of "editing" has been shifted ... my expectations of ribbon winners has been raised. In short... you rock my world!!! =)', '2007-07-09 01:14:50.000000', NULL, 0),
